equire every `derived_from` edge to resolve to at least `anchored`.\n4. When hashes are recorded, compare them. Missing hashes are allowed.\n5. Do not pretend to interpret unknown locator grammars. Keep them `anchored` unless an adapter proves more.\n\n### What verification should prove\n\nAt a minimum, a downstream verifier should be able to:\n\n- scan text-like artifacts for `@evidence[[...]]` refs\n- read `.prov.json` sidecars for generated artifacts\n- resolve refs against real files or stable ids\n- classify each link as `resolved`, `anchored`, or `dangling`\n- fail when a generated artifact has no input trail or when a claimed source does not exist\n{\n  \"$defs\": {\n    \"FigureFontSizes\": {\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"description\": \"Explicit font sizes for the legacy manifest contract.\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"axis\": {\n          \"title\": \"Axis\",\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"legend\": {\n          \"title\": \"Legend\",\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"ticks\": {\n          \"title\": \"Ticks\",\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"title\": {\n          \"title\": \"Title\",\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"title\",\n        \"axis\",\n        \"ticks\",\n        \"legend\"\n      ],\n      \"title\": \"FigureFontSizes\",\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"LegacyFigureManifestFigure\": {\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"allOf\": [\n        {\n          \"else\": {\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"path_pdf\": {\n                \"minLength\": 1\n              }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\n              \"path_pdf\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"if\": {\n            \"anyOf\": [\n              {\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"generator\": {\n                    \"const\": \"generate-concept-figure\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"generator\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"attempted_generator\": {\n                    \"const\": \"generate-concept-figure\"\n                  },\n                  \"fallback_reason\": {\n                    \"minLength\": 1,\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"generator\": {\n                    \"type\": \"null\"\n                  },\n                  \"prompt_log_path\": {\n                    \"minLength\": 1,\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"generator\",\n                  \"attempted_generator\",\n                  \"prompt_log_path\",\n                  \"fallback_reason\"\n                ]\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"Original flat figure-manifest entry shape.\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"attempted_generator\": {\n          \"anyOf\": [\n            {\n              \"enum\": [\n                \"generate-concept-figure\",\n                \"matplotlib\",\n                \"tikz\",\n                \"native_latex\",\n                \"manual\"\n              ],\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"null\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"default\": null,\n          \"title\": \"Attempted Generator\"\n        },\n        \"categories_per_panel\": {\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\n          },\n          \"title\": \"Categories Per Panel\",\n          \"type\": \"array\"\n        },\n        \"estimated_min_rendered_font_pt\": {\n          \"anyOf\": [\n            {\n              \"exclusiveMinimum\": 0,\n              \"type\": \"number\"\n            },","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
