{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwKJV7ohCVVtvDWAm866","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013fE9ciSnVYRKzBxdhaDhpf","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /workspace/paper; python3 - <<'E'\ns=open('paper.tex').read()\ndef rep(a,b):\n    global s\n    assert a in s, a[:50]\n    s=s.replace(a,b)\nrep(\"and in no single case does it reach 0.82 (Table~\\\\ref{tab:cases})\",\"and in no primary case does it reach 0.82 (Table~\\\\ref{tab:cases})\")\nrep(\"EB-IRT halves the naive interval score (P1:\",\"EB-IRT lowers the naive interval score by 37--48\\\\% (P1:\")\nrep(\"The evaluator's qualification outcome for this run is ``qualified'' with status ``completed''; this records that the controls were valid and every replication completed, and does not by itself establish validity beyond the studied worlds.\",\"The evaluator's qualification outcome for this run is ``qualified'' with status ``completed''. Gate diagnostics beyond that outcome are not available to us, and the outcome does not by itself establish validity beyond the studied worlds.\")\nrep(\"ranges from 1.40 to 1.63\",\"ranges from 1.43 to 1.63\")\nrep(\"The improvement concentrates in synthetic worlds, in small question budgets and in halving over simulated outcomes, where simpler reporters fail;\",\"The improvement concentrates in synthetic worlds, at small question budgets, and under halving relative to resampling;\")\nrep(\"Prompt and pipeline optimizers such as DSPy and MIPRO search over instructions, demonstrations and multi-call structures on a benchmark sample and then report the best configuration's score on that same sample \\\\citep{Khattab2023DSPy,OpsahlOng2024MIPRO}.\",\"Prompt and pipeline optimizers such as DSPy and MIPRO search over instructions, demonstrations and multi-call structures on a benchmark sample \\\\citep{Khattab2023DSPy,OpsahlOng2024MIPRO}, and in practice the best configuration is often reported with th